WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
Bonjour! Yes, yes, you are for the tour?

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.800
Très bien, welcome, mes amis. Welcome to Paris City Tours.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:08.200
Today I show you the real Paris. Follow me.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.200
Allez, allez, vis-sueil, mes amis!

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:13.200
Here, Place de la Bastille, very important for us in France.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.000
And this column commemorates the revolution of 1830.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:17.200
Very important, yes?

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:19.200
Oh, little bit to the left, this way.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:20.200
Très good, stay close.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:21.800
Bon, bon, we continue, vite, vite.

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:24.200
Ah, very good, keep moving, mes amis, perfect.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:27.000
Oh, small detour, much better this side.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:32.440
The fresh air, the famous Moulin Rouge, and of course, the Eiffel Tower.

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:36.060
And here, voilà, hung the Mona Lisa.

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:40.280
Ah, a little shower.

00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:41.720
Très refreshing, no?

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:44.180
This neighborhood is famous for its intellectual conversations.

00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:45.560
Very passionate people, the French.

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:49.160
Ah, the croissant, très French.

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:50.820
Our newest recipe, mes amis.

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:53.940
Here, very good for shopping.

00:00:54.140 --> 00:00:54.600
Très chic.

00:00:54.860 --> 00:00:56.080
Everybody duck, vite, vite.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.440
Très bien, everybody look happy!

00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:02.320
And from here, you have the most beautiful view of Paris.

00:01:02.760 --> 00:01:04.960
Well, here we are, your hotel.

00:01:05.340 --> 00:01:06.940
Au revoir, au revoir. Merci beaucoup.

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.060
Enjoy the rest of your stay in Paris.
